<title>LITHUANIA: Average yield on 88-day Lithuanian T-bills rises.</title>
<headline>Average yield on 88-day Lithuanian T-bills rises.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of 88-day Lithuanian Treasury bills was 12.67 percent on Thursday, higher than the 10.36 percent registered at an auction of 91-day paper on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD  (LAST TIME)  MIN/MAX   ISSUE   BID    SOLD</p>
<p>  88-day    12.67	10.36    11.88/13.97  50   57.359  36.359</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is December 23 and the bills mature on March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
